{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-template-js","path":"/linux/metricbeat-temperature","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"html":"<p>Although there is a plugin that possibly can fulfill our demand - <a href=\"https://github.com/eskibars/lmsensorsbeat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external nofollow noopener noreferrer\">lmsensorsbeat</a> - but I would not stop there.</p>\n<p>So if you want to over-engineer <a href=\"/linux/read-temperature-without-extra-tools\">this approach</a>, then keep reading.</p>\n<h2 id=\"making-your-own-beat\" style=\"position:relative;\">Making your own beat<a href=\"#making-your-own-beat\" aria-label=\"making your own beat permalink\" class=\"with-anchor after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"20\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"20\">\n                <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3\n                3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3\n                  9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64\n                  1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\">\n                </path>\n                </svg></a></h2>\n<p>We will be developing this thing in Go</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token function\">apt</span> <span class=\"token function\">install</span> golang golang-glide</code></pre></div>\n<p>Then start following <a href=\"https://www.elastic.co/guide/en/beats/devguide/current/beats-contributing.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external nofollow noopener noreferrer\">the official tutorial from Elastic</a>. I know, it's really written like they don't want you to develop your own plugins, they want you to pray for existence of in the marketplace.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token builtin class-name\">cd</span> metricbeat\n<span class=\"token function\">make</span> create-metricset <span class=\"token assign-left variable\">MODULE</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span>lmsensors <span class=\"token assign-left variable\">METRICSET</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span>lmsensors\n<span class=\"token comment\"># mage createMetricset</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># Module name: lmsensorsbeat</span>\n<span class=\"token comment\"># Metricset name: sensors</span></code></pre></div>\n<p>Edit <strong>module/lmsensors/lmsensors.go</strong></p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"go\"><pre class=\"language-go\"><code class=\"language-go\"><span class=\"token keyword\">package</span> lmsensors\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n\t<span class=\"token string\">\"sync\"</span>\n\n\t<span class=\"token string\">\"github.com/elastic/beats/v7/metricbeat/internal/sysinit\"</span>\n\t<span class=\"token string\">\"github.com/elastic/beats/v7/metricbeat/mb\"</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">func</span> <span class=\"token function\">init</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n\t<span class=\"token comment\">// Register the ModuleFactory function for this module.</span>\n\t<span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> err <span class=\"token operator\">:=</span> mb<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>Registry<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">AddModule</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>ModuleName<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> NewModule<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> err <span class=\"token operator\">!=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">nil</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"token function\">panic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>err<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\t<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token keyword\">func</span> <span class=\"token function\">NewModule</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>base mb<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>BaseModule<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>mb<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>Module<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">error</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n\t<span class=\"token keyword\">var</span> config Config\n\t<span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> err <span class=\"token operator\">:=</span> base<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span><span class=\"token function\">UnpackConfig</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token operator\">&amp;</span>config<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span> err <span class=\"token operator\">!=</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">nil</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n\t\t<span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">nil</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> err\n\t<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\t<span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token operator\">&amp;</span>base<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">nil</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\">// ModuleName is the name of this module.</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">const</span> ModuleName <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"lmsensors\"</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\"><span class=\"token function\">mkdir</span> <span class=\"token parameter variable\">-p</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">..</span>/x-pack/lmsensors/module  \n<span class=\"token function\">make</span> update <span class=\"token assign-left variable\">BEAT_NAME</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span>lmsensors <span class=\"token assign-left variable\">NO_COLLECT</span><span class=\"token operator\">=</span>true</code></pre></div>\n<p>Add external dependencies (<a href=\"https://github.com/eosswedenorg-go/gosensors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external nofollow noopener noreferrer\">gosensors</a>) to the beats project</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\">go get github.com/eskibars/gosensors</code></pre></div>\n<p>Run it as</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"bash\"><pre class=\"language-bash\"><code class=\"language-bash\">./metricbeat  \n<span class=\"token parameter variable\">-c</span> metricbeat.yml  \n<span class=\"token parameter variable\">--path.home</span> <span class=\"token builtin class-name\">.</span>  \n<span class=\"token parameter variable\">--path.config</span> <span class=\"token builtin class-name\">.</span>  \n<span class=\"token parameter variable\">--path.data</span> <span class=\"token builtin class-name\">.</span>  \n<span class=\"token parameter variable\">--path.logs</span> <span class=\"token builtin class-name\">.</span></code></pre></div>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/util-linux/util-linux/blob/d155c11d2e5374623d16c6bae7198ec9b8f479bb/sys-utils/lscpu-cputype.c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://github.com/util-linux/util-linux/blob/d155c11d2e5374623d16c6bae7198ec9b8f479bb/sys-utils/lscpu-cputype.c</a></p>\n<h3 id=\"another-examples\" style=\"position:relative;\">Another examples<a href=\"#another-examples\" aria-label=\"another examples permalink\" class=\"with-anchor after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"20\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"20\">\n                <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3\n                3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3\n                  9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64\n                  1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\">\n                </path>\n                </svg></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/eBay/nvidiagpubeat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external nofollow noopener noreferrer\">nvidiagpubeat</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/awormuth/amazonbeat/blob/master/Makefile\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Makefile</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/live-wire/terminalbeat/blob/master/Makefile\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Makefile</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"elastic-forum-threads\" style=\"position:relative;\">Elastic Forum Threads<a href=\"#elastic-forum-threads\" aria-label=\"elastic forum threads permalink\" class=\"with-anchor after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"20\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"20\">\n                <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3\n                3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3\n                  9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64\n                  1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\">\n                </path>\n                </svg></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://discuss.elastic.co/t/cpu-temp-and-deployment-status/206659\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external nofollow noopener noreferrer\">CPU temperatur</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://discuss.elastic.co/t/how-to-monitor-cpu-and-other-device-temps/196679\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external nofollow noopener noreferrer\">How to monitor CPU temperature?</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://discuss.elastic.co/t/raspberry-pi-4s-cpu-temperature-monitoring/227874\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Raspberry Pi 4 CPU temperature monitoring</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"open-issues-on-elastic-beats\" style=\"position:relative;\">Open Issues on Elastic Beats<a href=\"#open-issues-on-elastic-beats\" aria-label=\"open issues on elastic beats permalink\" class=\"with-anchor after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" height=\"20\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"20\">\n                <path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3\n                3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3\n                  9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64\n                  1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\">\n                </path>\n                </svg></a></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/elastic/beats/issues/11848\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"external nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Enhancement: expanded CPU monitoring</a></li>\n</ul>","excerpt":"Although there is a plugin that possibly can fulfill our demand - lmsensorsbeat - but I would not stop there. So if you want to over…","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#making-your-own-beat\">Making your own beat</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#another-examples\">Another examples</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#elastic-forum-threads\">Elastic Forum Threads</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#open-issues-on-elastic-beats\">Open Issues on Elastic Beats</a